WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.476
Collagen cream does not replace

00:00:01.496 --> 00:00:03.463
your collagen. Collagen powder does

00:00:03.483 --> 00:00:04.685
not travel straight to your

00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:05.200
face.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.574
So where does it go?

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:10.228
Across 23 trials, it appears to help.

00:00:10.228 --> 00:00:12.160
Remove the industry funded studies,

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.955
and the answer changes.

00:00:14.005 --> 00:00:16.422
Think of your skin as a building.

00:00:16.422 --> 00:00:18.990
Collagen is the main structure inside it.

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.312
It keeps everything firm and upright.

00:00:21.332 --> 00:00:26.878
As we age, collagen production

00:00:26.878 --> 00:00:31.415
slows. And ultraviolet light switches
on enzymes that cut collagen apart.

00:00:31.415 --> 00:00:33.664
The sun runs a demolition crew.

00:00:33.684 --> 00:00:34.842
It works weekends.

00:00:34.862 --> 00:00:36.585
Sunscreen is not just about sunburn.

00:00:36.585 --> 00:00:39.530
It draws a boundary around the building.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:43.950
Preserving collagen is usually
easier than replacing it later.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.472
Now, the cream.

00:00:45.492 --> 00:00:48.733
To pass through skin, a molecule
generally needs to be under

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:50.177
500 daltons.

00:00:50.177 --> 00:00:54.300
Collagen is around 300,000.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.895
It is not getting through that door.

00:00:56.915 --> 00:01:00.235
It may still form a moisturising
film on the surface.

00:01:00.235 --> 00:01:02.179
Skin may feel smoother.

00:01:02.199 --> 00:01:07.289
But polishing the windows
is not replacing the beams.

00:01:07.339 --> 00:01:08.883
Now, the powder.

00:01:08.903 --> 00:01:14.216
Swallow collagen, and digestion breaks
it into peptides and amino acids.

00:01:14.216 --> 00:01:15.493
Your stomach does not

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:16.548
offer facial delivery.

00:01:16.568 --> 00:01:18.742
But your body decides where they go,

00:01:18.742 --> 00:01:23.110
to skin, joints, tendons, or
wherever repairs are most urgent.

00:01:23.179 --> 00:01:24.343
Your face ordered scaffolding.

00:01:24.343 --> 00:01:26.519
It got spare parts instead.

00:01:26.539 --> 00:01:28.901
Trials do point to a modest benefit.

00:01:29.151 --> 00:01:32.856
Does the powder work? Trials do report
modest improvements in hydration,

00:01:32.876 --> 00:01:34.712
elasticity, or wrinkles.

00:01:34.732 --> 00:01:36.389
But many were small, short,

00:01:36.389 --> 00:01:38.160
and industry funded.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:42.296
In 2025, researchers pooled
23 randomised trials.

00:01:42.296 --> 00:01:44.388
All together, a benefit.

00:01:44.388 --> 00:01:46.048
Keep only the studies
without industry funding, and

00:01:46.068 --> 00:01:47.068
it is no

00:01:47.088 --> 00:01:49.409
longer statistically significant.

00:01:49.429 --> 00:01:50.429
Keep only the

00:01:50.449 --> 00:01:51.270
higher quality studies.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.427
Same result. The effect stops showing up.

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:54.696
Do supplements definitely work?

00:01:54.696 --> 00:01:55.939
We cannot say that.

00:01:55.939 --> 00:01:57.051
Definitely fail?

00:01:57.071 --> 00:01:59.082
We cannot confidently say that either.

00:01:59.082 --> 00:02:01.261
The independent evidence is uncertain.

00:02:01.511 --> 00:02:02.908
What the evidence actually supports.

00:02:02.928 --> 00:02:04.817
Broad spectrum sunscreen, every day.

00:02:04.837 --> 00:02:08.053
Not smoking. Enough protein and vitamin C.

00:02:08.053 --> 00:02:12.137
And for suitable users, topical retinoids
have considerably stronger evidence for

00:02:12.137 --> 00:02:14.541
encouraging collagen
production than collagen cream.

00:02:14.561 --> 00:02:16.946
Collagen cream can be
a pleasant moisturiser.

00:02:16.946 --> 00:02:17.946
Collagen powder is

00:02:17.966 --> 00:02:21.915
optional. Protect the building before
you buy expensive powdered bricks.
